Layout, unmodified: library/*.c and library/*.h at this directory's root,
include/mbedtls/ and include/psa/ as mbedtls/ and psa/, with the default
mbedtls/mbedtls_config.h except for one change: MBEDTLS_THREADING_C and
MBEDTLS_THREADING_PTHREAD are on (#6694). Task threads run concurrent
handshakes, and the config's own MBEDTLS_THREADING_C note requires the
threading layer for any TLS 1.3 connection used from more than one thread
(PSA's key slots and global state are shared); a program's C closure links
musl, whose pthread mutexes back it. The 3rdparty/ drivers (p256-m, everest)
are omitted; only configs that are off by default include them.

jet_tls.c is Jet's own file (#5484): context alloc/free, socket BIO wiring,
roots, identity, hostname/ALPN and handshake/read/write/close mechanics.
It returns raw mbedTLS status codes; core.net.tls (Core/Net/Tls.jet) owns
every policy and error meaning.
